        "liquid_VUQYTK": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2><a href=\"https://oneisall.com/blogs/all/meet-oneisall-at-jill-zarins-luxury-luncheon\">Meet Oneisall at Jill Zarin's Luxury Luncheon</a></h2><p>There is Jill Zarin, a popular star who is seen as outgoing and fun-based on her entertaining events; she is holding her Luxury Luncheon Party in the Hamptons. This lavish event is set to occur on July 20, and the culture vultures, socialites, celebrities, and influencers would be hoping to taste the best summer event ever. <a href=\"https://oneisall.com/blogs/all/meet-oneisall-at-jill-zarins-luxury-luncheon\">Read More...</a></p>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        }
      },
